# Canonical Claude/Gemini session-artifact ignore-list (see CRUFT-SEPARATION-STANDARD
# on tank). Append to a repo's .gitignore so session scaffolding never gets tracked.
# These belong in /tank/claude-workspace/<repo>/, not on GitHub.
CLAUDE[0-9._-]*.md
CLAUDE_[A-Z]*.md
GEMINI_*.md
GEMINI[._-]*
claude[0-9]_*.md
*HANDOFF*
*handoff*
RESUME-*.md
SESSION-LOG*
SESSION_LOG*
SESSION_HANDOFF*
SESSION-HANDOFF*
AI-COORDINATION.md
.remember/
# Live coordination state — ignore only once the cross-session comms method replaces it:
# CLAIMS.md
# comms/from-*.md
